<h2 id=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>The brute force solution to this problem involves iterating through ever=
y possible subarray and checking if their sum equals k. It takes <span clas=
s=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1=
998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=3D"false">(</mo><m=
